       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the maximum labeled daily dose.\n\n- **Per dose:** 1600 mg is double the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Per day:** 6,400 mg is double the 3,200 mg/day ceiling for prescription use in adults. The risks include GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't remove those risks at this dose.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, four times daily** (3,200 mg/day). This is the maximum for inflammatory conditions.\n- **400\u2013800 mg by mouth, three times daily**. This is typical for pain or inflammation.\n- **1600 mg total per day, divided** (for example, 400 mg four times daily).\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me the clinical rationale and I'll add it as a note on the order. Many systems also require pharmacy or attending verification for doses above the maximum. Otherwise, give me the corrected dose and frequency and I'll enter it."
      }
     ],
